     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table15.B2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P2"><text:span text:style-name="T9">3</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table15.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P7"><text:span text:style-name="T8">Parada</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table15.B2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P2"><text:span text:style-name="T9">+2</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table15.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P7"><text:span text:style-name="T8">Armadura</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table15.B2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P2"><text:span text:style-name="T9">2d6</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Arco corto: competencia 3, daño 4, filo 14. Daño especial: Perforar.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Cuchillo: competencia 2, daño 3, filo 14.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Ojo de hermana. Si Grith cae herido, Moraig gasta 1 Resolución y su siguiente ataque es favorito. Si Grith muere delante de ella, carga contra quien lo abatió y deja de aceptar tregua.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P8" text:outline-level="3"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Tres salteadores dunlendinos</text:span></text:h>
